# The node_exporter textfile collector's directory on the Pi. homelab-updater, which runs as root,
# writes homelab_host.prom here and exits non-zero without creating the directory when it is
# missing. This line is the directory's only creator on the Pi. The owner contract is root,
# group {{ sys_user }}, mode 2775: the group lets a {{ sys_user }} writer in, and setgid keeps that group on new files.
# node_exporter.service runs systemd-tmpfiles --create on this file in ExecStartPre=, and
# systemd-tmpfiles-setup.service applies it at boot.
#Type Path                            Mode User Group           Age
d /var/lib/node-exporter-textfile     2775 root {{ sys_user }}  -
